									<p style="margin:0"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#0E0D12">Another Salon</b><br><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:1px">★★★</span> <span style="color:#5D5B66;font-size:12px">3.7 (47)</span></p>								</div>
