									<p style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0">Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-773f13aa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="773f13aa" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Marketing built for <span class="hl">how fast nail clients decide</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9d0fb35 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9d0fb35" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-389d84ea e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="389d84ea" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52330e50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="52330e50" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Nail salon clients in the UAE are the most digitally native, convenience-driven segment in the whole beauty market — genuinely booking appointments at 2am via Instagram DM, deciding in seconds based on a photo and a price. A salon that isn&#8217;t instantly bookable, with real photos and transparent pricing, loses that client to whoever answers first.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-46e5c963 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="46e5c963" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Real hygiene compliance is real content, not just a claim</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-18490c76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="18490c76" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>The UAE&#8217;s 2023 Health and Safety Standards for Personal Care Establishments specifically mandate hygiene protocols, staff certification and approved products for nail salons — a genuine regulatory fact worth featuring prominently, not a vague &#8220;clean and safe&#8221; claim every competitor makes identically.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6cfdb7f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6cfdb7f5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">One of the most saturated markets in UAE beauty</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1d24c3a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1d24c3a2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>With hundreds of nail salons across Dubai alone, differentiation happens almost entirely through visible proof — portfolio content, review volume, and Maps ranking — rather than service descriptions that read identically across every competitor.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a0b932f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4a0b932f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55c79bb6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="55c79bb6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px">Nail salons, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:120px">2am</b><span>bookings via Instagram are a real, documented pattern</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:120px">5</b><span>service categories, different discovery paths each</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:120px">2023 DHA standards</b><span>— a real compliance story to tell</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:120px">Portfolio content</b><span>outperforms every other asset type here</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
