									<p style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0">The difference, in one table</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-73f5fe74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="73f5fe74" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
