												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do nail clients really book appointments at 2am?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2031" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2031"><p>Yes — this is a documented, common behaviour pattern in the UAE nail market. Clients discover a salon on Instagram late at night and expect to book immediately, not wait for a reply the next morning.</p></div>
