														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Is Instagram really more important than Google for nail salons?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-2032" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-2032"><p>For nail art specifically, often yes — it&#8217;s the most visually and socially driven category in beauty, and discovery skews heavily toward Instagram and similar platforms over search. Other categories like gel manicures still lean more on Google and Maps.</p></div>
				</div>
